On 6 Jun 2000 kent at darwin.eeb.uconn.edu wrote:

> Thank you to everyone who responded to my request for help with
> understanding how to specify a split-plot design in S-Plus. After
> reading the discussion in V&R 3 again in the light of the responses I
> received here, I think I now have a pretty good grasp of what's going
