In general, it is impossible.  Postscript is a full programming language,
and the MS formats are far from that.

However, I assume you just want to take a postscript *figure* and import
it to Office?  You can import postscript figures if you have the right
filters installed. Or you can convert to bitmaps in GhostScript....

You can have a fully fledged LaTeX system under Windows, too.

If that is not enough, could you tell us exactly what you want to do?

