adding to the first data.frame a dummy column as follows

   time <- sort( unique( fit$time ) )
   stime <- data.frame( time, dummy=rep( 1, length( time ) ) )

the error will not occur, but this is not a logical solution !!!

Is this a bug of merge function in Splus 2000 ?

