That is actually a bug in step.gam, which fails to extract the offset from
the original model and include it in any subsequent models. A fix for
that, which works fine for me (using S-Plus 3.4 or S-Plus 5.1), is to add 
the following lines to step.gam: 

lines 23&24:
        if(!is.null(a$offset))
        off1 <- deparse(a$variables[[a$offset]])

lines 46&47 (immediately prior to the return() statement):
        if(!is.null(a$offset))
        term.labels <- paste(off1, term.labels, sep = " + ")

Fernanda

