Bruce's 'kludge' (see below) is device dependent. font=8 works with windows
metafile format, but for a postscript device you need font=13. For a
graphsheet window I found the greek always prints horizontally irrespective
of the srt argument. But then I guess getting greek on the window is less
important than getting it into a printable format.

Here are Bruce's examples for ps and wmf formats. The fine-tuning
(at=,line=) is also device dependent, so the ps doesn't look quite right.

ps:

postscript(file="c:/dump/plot.ps")
# use "oma" to ensure enough room to plot axis labels
par(oma=c(1,1,1,1))
# put up a null plot
plot(0,0,xlim=c(-2730,3777),ylim=c(-120,95), ylab="",xlab="",type="n")
mtext("COST -                NB",side=2,line=3,font=1,outer=F,at=-30,srt=90)
mtext("(b  / g    )",side=2,line=3,font=13,outer=F,at=-20,srt=90)# <-font13
mtext(" ^",side=2,line=3.5,outer=F,at=-32,srt=90)
mtext("_",side=2,line=3.8,outer=F,at=-16,srt=90)
mtext("T",side=2,line=2.5,font=1,outer=F,at=-27,srt=90,cex=0.8)
mtext("NB",side=2,line=2.5,font=1,outer=F,at=-12,srt=90,cex=0.8)

mtext("NB -                  BO",side=1,line=3,font=1,outer=F,at=1000,srt=0)
mtext("(g    / g     )",side=1,line=3,font=8,outer=F,at=1100,srt=0)
mtext("_",side=1,line=2.2,font=1,outer=F,at=1145,srt=0)
mtext("_",side=1,line=2.2,font=1,outer=F,at=816,srt=0)
mtext("NB",side=1,line=4,font=1,outer=F,at=965,srt=0,cex=0.8)
mtext("BO",side=1,line=4,font=1,outer=F,at=1300,srt=0,cex=0.8)
dev.off()

wmf:

graphsheet(file="plot.wmf",format="WMF")
# use "oma" to ensure enough room to plot axis labels
par(oma=c(1,1,1,1))
# put up a null plot
plot(0,0,xlim=c(-2730,3777),ylim=c(-120,95), ylab="",xlab="",type="n")
mtext("COST -                NB",side=2,line=3,font=1,outer=F,at=-30,srt=90)
mtext("(b  / g    )",side=2,line=3,font=8,outer=F,at=-20,srt=90) # <-font 8
mtext(" ^",side=2,line=3.5,outer=F,at=-32,srt=90)
mtext("_",side=2,line=3.8,outer=F,at=-16,srt=90)
mtext("T",side=2,line=2.5,font=1,outer=F,at=-27,srt=90,cex=0.8)
mtext("NB",side=2,line=2.5,font=1,outer=F,at=-12,srt=90,cex=0.8)

mtext("NB -                  BO",side=1,line=3,font=1,outer=F,at=1000,srt=0)
mtext("(g    / g     )",side=1,line=3,font=8,outer=F,at=1100,srt=0)
mtext("_",side=1,line=2.2,font=1,outer=F,at=1145,srt=0)
mtext("_",side=1,line=2.2,font=1,outer=F,at=816,srt=0)
mtext("NB",side=1,line=4,font=1,outer=F,at=965,srt=0,cex=0.8)
mtext("BO",side=1,line=4,font=1,outer=F,at=1300,srt=0,cex=0.8)
dev.off()

